OL,3,AOfficers injured and vehicles damaged
OL,4,Ain Portsmouth small boats protest,
OL,5,Apolice say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has condemned
OL,8,F"intimidating and thuggish behaviour"
OL,9,Fat the protest. Reform UK's Nigel
OL,10,FFarage says: "Peaceful protest: good.
OL,11,FUniforms and masks: bad"
OL,13,FFarage was referring to a similar
OL,14,Fprotest in Dover on Saturday, where
OL,15,Fdemonstrators wore all black and face
OL,16,Fcoverings - Daniel Sandford looks at
OL,17,Fthe connections
